ध्यानात्कर्मफलत्यागस्त्यागाच्छान्तिरनन्तरम् ॥ १२ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3559,\"bb\":3136,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/12/12/b3136/\",\"body_value\":\"śreyo hi jñānam abhyāsāj
jñānād dhyānaṁ viśiṣyate
dhyānāt karma-phala-tyāgas
tyāgāc chāntir anantaram\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3560,\"bb\":3137,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/12/12/b3137/\",\"shadow_value\":\"śreyaḥ – better; hi – certainly; jñānam – knowledge; abhyāsāt – than practice; jñānāt – than knowledge; dhyānam – meditation; viśiṣyate – is considered better; dhyānāt – than meditation; karma-phala-tyāgaḥ – renunciation of the results of fruitive action; tyāgāt – by such renunciation; śāntiḥ – peace; anantaram – thereafter.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"śreyaḥ\",\"translation\":\"better\"},{\"word\":\"hi\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"jñānam\",\"translation\":\"knowledge\"},{\"word\":\"abhyāsāt\",\"translation\":\"than practice\"},{\"word\":\"jñānāt\",\"translation\":\"than knowledge\"},{\"word\":\"dhyānam\",\"translation\":\"meditation\"},{\"word\":\"viśiṣyate\",\"translation\":\"is considered better\"},{\"word\":\"dhyānāt\",\"translation\":\"than meditation\"},{\"word\":\"karma-phala-tyāgaḥ\",\"translation\":\"renunciation of the results of fruitive action\"},{\"word\":\"tyāgāt\",\"translation\":\"by such renunciation\"},{\"word\":\"śāntiḥ\",\"translation\":\"peace\"},{\"word\":\"anantaram\",\"translation\":\"thereafter\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3561,\"bb\":3138,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/12/12/b3138/\",\"body_value\":\"If you cannot take to this practice, then engage yourself in the cultivation of knowledge. Better than knowledge, however, is meditation, and better than meditation is renunciation of the fruits of action, for by such renunciation one can attain peace of mind.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3562,\"bb\":3139,\"url_path\":\"/en/libra